  "biography": {
    "plain_text": "Hélène Faggionato-Knight is a Swiss honorary consul representing Monaco in Zurich. Born in Monaco, she was appointed vice-consul in 1998 and promoted to consul in 2000. Her longstanding service links the principality with German-speaking Switzerland. She is a knight of the Order of Grimaldi and has also chaired a Swiss charitable foundation.",
    "html": "<p>Hélène Faggionato-Knight is a Swiss honorary consul representing Monaco in Zurich. Born in Monaco, she was appointed vice-consul in 1998 and promoted to consul in 2000. Her longstanding service links the principality with German-speaking Switzerland. She is a knight of the Order of Grimaldi and has also chaired a Swiss charitable foundation.</p>\r\n",
    "word_count": 52,
    "confidence": {
      "score": 95,
